{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Approach visible object, inspect it, take it, perform task, return object. If none found, search.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = InspectObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ReturnObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
